  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 713.07 Recordkeeping and Reporting for Secondaries. The O/O shall:\n\n(a) Maintain records as specified in Env-Dw 718; and\n\n(b) Report SMCL monitoring results as specified in Env-Dw 719.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19",
